   426→
   427→## Benefits
   428→
   429→### ✅ No Code Duplication
   430→- Simulation engine is single source of truth
   431→- Both Node.js and browser import the same code
   432→- Changes to engine automatically apply to both modes
   433→
   434→### ✅ Non-Breaking for Monte Carlo
   435→- `scripts/monteCarloSimulation.ts` continues to work unchanged
